WEBVTT

00:00:00.568 --> 00:00:01.456
SIX.

00:00:02.172 --> 00:00:07.734
MISTER BAKER, durkh di, di ale yorn fun fertsik biz zeks un fertsik, hot ir a mol prubirt

00:00:07.875 --> 00:00:09.438
tsu shikn briv

00:00:10.272 --> 00:00:11.346
aheym?

00:00:11.875 --> 00:00:13.691
NO. kh'hob nisht ge-

00:00:13.714 --> 00:00:16.037
s- g- ven ikh bin gevezn

00:00:16.431 --> 00:00:19.277
in di lagern, dos iz geven ummeglekh

00:00:19.384 --> 00:00:20.424
tsu shikn.

00:00:20.312 --> 00:00:21.875
⟨un⟩ in KOLKHOZ?

00:00:20.886 --> 00:00:25.987
ikh hob, yo, in di, in lager, ⟨biz⟩ shpeter in KOLKHOZ, ven ikh bin geven, hob ikh yo

00:00:25.987 --> 00:00:26.904
geshikt

00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:31.055
ober demolst UNK nisht gearbet shoyn d- s'iz geven di milkhome tsvishn

00:00:31.095 --> 00:00:34.970
Rusland mit Daytshland. s'iz shoyn nisht ge- hot nisht geganen keyn post

00:00:35.128 --> 00:00:40.809
nor ven ikh bin in zeks un fertsikstn yor a- adurkhgeforn Moskve

00:00:41.153 --> 00:00:44.758
ikh bin geven tsen tog in Moskve. ven ikh bin aheymgeforn

00:00:44.798 --> 00:00:46.446
hot men undz gegebn

00:00:46.603 --> 00:00:47.727
a WAGON

00:00:48.173 --> 00:00:49.883
un du veyst az di s-

00:00:49.883 --> 00:00:54.863
di komunistishe propagande, m'hot oyfgeklept a groysn plakat oyfn WAGON

00:00:54.863 --> 00:00:58.413
ZA ZDRASTVUYTE POLSKI-SOVETSKI SHAKHTYORI

00:00:58.413 --> 00:01:00.093
Menakhem Mendl a SHAKHTYOR

00:01:00.492 --> 00:01:02.851
iz un

00:01:02.851 --> 00:01:06.156
UNK di WAGON tsugetshepet tsu a tsug

00:01:06.718 --> 00:01:09.740
un a tog vi der ts- iz

00:01:09.740 --> 00:01:12.060
iz er geganen di, der UNK

00:01:12.060 --> 00:01:15.940
shnel, hot der WAGON zikh azoy gevorfn, m'hot gemeynt m'vet zikh iberdreyen

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:18.812
zenen mir tsugeforn biz CHELYABINSK.

00:01:18.987 --> 00:01:20.618
dos iz oyfn veg.

00:01:20.893 --> 00:01:23.789
in CHELYABINSK iz do a groyse statsye

00:01:24.353 --> 00:01:26.223
iz, iz avekgeganen

00:01:26.223 --> 00:01:29.063
UNK tsvey fun undz, ⟨zenen mir⟩ geven fir un tsvontsik yidn.

00:01:29.063 --> 00:01:30.743
zenen zey aheymgeforn fun di shakht.

00:01:31.086 --> 00:01:35.923
iz UNK gegan a delegatsye tsu dem natshalnik fun di statsye, me zol undz

00:01:36.621 --> 00:01:40.125
gebn an andern WAGON, ⟨vet, m'vet⟩ umkumen in dem WAGON.

00:01:40.384 --> 00:01:44.090
in a, ⟨bazundersh, der⟩ WAGON iz geforn ven s'iz gevezn

00:01:44.090 --> 00:01:48.970
a veg iz zi geforn. anisht hot men undz avekgeshtelt in a zayt, un m'hot gekent opshteln tsvey dray tog

00:01:48.970 --> 00:01:50.720
un keyn esn hot men nisht gegebn.

00:01:51.353 --> 00:01:54.502
iz men avekgeganen. der natshalnik iz geven a general

00:01:54.610 --> 00:01:58.046
fun dortn ⟨oyf⟩ di, es iz a groyse WEZLOWA statsye

00:01:58.373 --> 00:02:02.647
iz geven bar undz a khaver fun, geven fun Lemberg, hot gekent redn gut rusish

00:02:02.647 --> 00:02:06.517
iz er mit, tsugeganen. ikh bin grade mitgeganen mit im

00:02:06.591 --> 00:02:09.639
un s'iz geshtanen a zelner bay dem hoyz

00:02:09.729 --> 00:02:12.200
un m'hot gezogt me vil zen ⟨dem⟩ natshalnik

00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:15.110
hot er aroyfge⟨UNK⟩ az s'iz do do POLSKIE

00:02:15.110 --> 00:02:17.520
UNK, poylishe birger, zey viln ⟨im⟩ zen

00:02:17.762 --> 00:02:20.945
hot er gezogt az tsvey mentshn zoln aroyfgeyn

00:02:21.103 --> 00:02:23.105
ANYWAYS, UNK m'iz aroyfgeganen

00:02:23.584 --> 00:02:28.778
un m'hot gezogt vos vegn me fort fun a shakht. m'hot opgearbet dray yor. yetst fort men aheym

00:02:28.778 --> 00:02:32.944
un me shtelt undz avek in di zayt m- a por tog, m'hot, me git nisht keyn esn

00:02:33.118 --> 00:02:35.258
hot er gezogt "ikh vel derleydikn"

00:02:35.258 --> 00:02:37.857
un hot undz oysgeshribn bald

00:02:37.857 --> 00:02:40.183
broyt mit konservn

00:02:40.307 --> 00:02:43.271
un er hot gezogt morgn vet geyn a tsug

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:47.473
keyn Moskve, un s'vet forn glaykh keyn Moskve. azoy iz gevezn.

00:02:47.631 --> 00:02:49.582
ikh zog im "keyn Moskve

00:02:49.774 --> 00:02:51.810
hobn mir gevolt zayn a por tog

00:02:51.850 --> 00:02:53.025
in Moskve."

00:02:53.048 --> 00:02:57.294
iz vos tut a yid? m'iz geganen tsum natshalnik, un m'hot im gegebn

00:02:57.638 --> 00:02:59.286
fuftsn hundert rubl

00:02:59.427 --> 00:03:01.176
un er hot avekgeshtelt

00:03:01.637 --> 00:03:03.841
undzer vagon in a zayt

00:03:04.017 --> 00:03:07.253
un mir zenen dortn gevezn tsen tog m-

00:03:07.253 --> 00:03:09.528
m'hot ibergelozt yedn tog a mentsh

00:03:09.906 --> 00:03:15.536
vos er zol hitn di zakhn, un mir zenen ganen geforn in shtot arayn, UNK gegan in di opere

00:03:15.627 --> 00:03:19.986
m'iz geganen dort, un farshidene pletser iz dortn do in Moskve

00:03:19.986 --> 00:03:21.479
a plats a

00:03:21.479 --> 00:03:22.618
dos heyst

00:03:22.618 --> 00:03:24.415
⟨TROFEINAYA VYSTAVKA⟩

00:03:24.415 --> 00:03:27.129
dortn, dos vos zey hobn genumen gefangen

00:03:27.642 --> 00:03:30.808
bay di daytshn in di milkhome. geven a oysshtelung.

00:03:30.949 --> 00:03:34.928
iz beemes iz geven tsu bavundern vi zey hobn dos nokh bavizn bald

00:03:34.928 --> 00:03:37.001
nokh di milkhome tsu makhn

00:03:37.227 --> 00:03:38.877
ir hot gekent zen yedes

00:03:38.877 --> 00:03:42.097
yede mundir vos a daytsh hot getrogn iz dort geven

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:46.266
un oysgeshtelt alts gemakht dort. m'hot gedorfn oysgeyn

00:03:46.373 --> 00:03:51.176
a por tog biz me zol alding, un m'iz arumge⟨gan⟩ in Moskve. m'hot gezen

00:03:51.199 --> 00:03:53.707
iz ts- un gegesn hobn mir

00:03:53.815 --> 00:03:57.338
bay di, in di STOLOVA in a restoran

00:03:57.338 --> 00:03:58.972
fun di ban arbeter

00:04:00.075 --> 00:04:03.950
mir zenen gevezn, un nakher zenen mir avekgeforn keyn Poyln.

00:04:04.378 --> 00:04:07.004
m'iz ongekumen in dem shtot Brisk

00:04:07.213 --> 00:04:09.755
zenen mit undz geforn in undzer shalon

00:04:09.778 --> 00:04:11.125
dray vagonen

00:04:11.125 --> 00:04:13.569
polyakn vos zenen oykhet aheymgeforn.

00:04:13.828 --> 00:04:17.551
zenen gekumen, hobn zey oyfgeshribn oyf zeyere vagonen

00:04:17.743 --> 00:04:19.002
mit krayd

00:04:19.060 --> 00:04:21.281
a, gemakht a, a tseylem

00:04:21.387 --> 00:04:23.806
"TU JADA POLACY." do forn

00:04:23.806 --> 00:04:24.757
polyakn.

00:04:24.831 --> 00:04:28.203
iz geven poylishe arbeter. zey hobn gearbet oyf di UNK

00:04:28.203 --> 00:04:29.600
der CONSTRUCTION

00:04:29.623 --> 00:04:32.343
hobn zey ongehoybn undz bavarfn mit shteyner

00:04:32.343 --> 00:04:33.243
az m'hot

00:04:33.243 --> 00:04:37.293
i- dos iz geven TOWAROWA vagonen, veyst dokh vi me farrukt di tirn

00:04:38.030 --> 00:04:42.049
hot men gemuzt farmakhn, un zey hobn ge- ongehoybn bombardirn mit shteyner undz

00:04:42.049 --> 00:04:43.479
az do forn yidn.

00:04:43.479 --> 00:04:47.180
dos iz geven der oyfname vos m'hot undz oyfgenumen in Poyln.

00:04:47.848 --> 00:04:49.321
az ikh vil farshteyn

00:04:49.321 --> 00:04:54.519
ven ir l- zent aroy- bafrayt in zeks un fertsikstn yor fun, fun sha- fun di shakhtn, fun

00:04:54.519 --> 00:04:56.566
ir zent ge- geforn vu?

00:04:54.582 --> 00:04:55.436
yo

00:04:56.708 --> 00:04:57.984
keyn Poyln.

00:04:56.725 --> 00:05:00.414
glaykh keyn, glaykh, neyn, neyn, in zeks un fertsik

00:05:00.015 --> 00:05:00.802
yo

00:05:00.707 --> 00:05:04.143
ven, fu- fu- fun, unter di rusn

00:05:03.846 --> 00:05:04.667
yo

00:05:04.673 --> 00:05:06.557
vu zayt ir geforn frier?

00:05:06.681 --> 00:05:07.924
keyn Moskve?

00:05:07.828 --> 00:05:11.068
mir zenen geforn fun, fun dortn UNK

00:05:11.068 --> 00:05:13.438
keyn Moskve, un fun Moskve keyn Poyln.

00:05:12.756 --> 00:05:13.478
aha.

00:05:13.478 --> 00:05:15.284
fun vanet hot ir genumen di finef

00:05:15.284 --> 00:05:17.508
d- fuftsn hundert rubl

00:05:17.565 --> 00:05:20.630
tsu ⟨basholn⟩, ah batsoln dem nasha- natshalnik?

00:05:18.915 --> 00:05:22.472
yo. ven m'iz aroysgeforn, mir hobn gegebn

00:05:22.472 --> 00:05:24.427
oyfn VOENNE ZAYEM

00:05:24.467 --> 00:05:30.840
dos heyst e- yeder m- m-, g- di regirung hot genumen bay di arbeter, bay yedn birger

00:05:31.065 --> 00:05:32.071
gelt

00:05:32.331 --> 00:05:35.987
VOENNE ZAYEM, kh'veyst nisht vi azoy dos ⟨vel ikh⟩ aykh tsu bash-

00:05:36.280 --> 00:05:40.020
m'hot gegebn gelt, hot men gefirt, geborgt gelt di regirung

00:05:40.785 --> 00:05:44.829
azoy vi m'iz gan avekforn, hobn zey undz oysgetsolt

00:05:45.038 --> 00:05:47.006
vos ir hot gearbet in di shakhtn.

00:05:45.139 --> 00:05:48.729
dos gelt vos, vos m'hot, ven ⟨s'hot aropgenumen⟩, m'hot

00:05:48.729 --> 00:05:51.889
geborgt di regirung. se heyst oyf rusish VOENNE ZAYEM.

00:05:51.889 --> 00:05:53.320
m'hot geborgt di regirung.

00:05:53.320 --> 00:05:55.747
hot men gekrign oysgetsolt a por toyznt.

00:05:55.669 --> 00:05:56.658
rubl.

00:05:56.192 --> 00:05:57.007
rubl.

00:05:57.007 --> 00:06:01.552
bazunder s'iz gevezn vos mir zenen gan in Moskve in di poylishe ambasador

00:06:01.710 --> 00:06:03.931
hobn mir gekrign tsu toyznt zlotes

00:06:05.322 --> 00:06:07.824
azoy hobn zey, dos hobn, nor mir hobn gegat

00:06:07.824 --> 00:06:08.808
dos gelt.

00:06:09.473 --> 00:06:11.644
az ir zent geforn fun Moskve

00:06:11.835 --> 00:06:12.689
keyn

00:06:11.886 --> 00:06:15.761
k- mit a shalon. s'hot nisht, undz, az zey hobn nisht gedorfn nemen keyn biletn.

00:06:16.425 --> 00:06:20.283
m'hot undz gefirt. in Rusland fort men nisht ⟨aleyn⟩. ⟨durkh⟩ Rusland firt ⟨men⟩.

00:06:20.998 --> 00:06:22.629
⟨az⟩ zent ir geforn?

00:06:22.517 --> 00:06:27.427
biz Poyln. m'iz gekumen keyn Poyln biz ⟨zenen mir⟩ geforn undzer shalon

00:06:27.427 --> 00:06:30.417
biz a shtot. dos heyst SZCZECIN.

00:06:30.685 --> 00:06:34.560
SZCZECIN, dos iz a mol geven a daytshishe shtot.

00:06:35.123 --> 00:06:37.364
nor nokh di milkhome hot dos balangt

00:06:37.364 --> 00:06:38.475
tsu Poyln.

00:06:39.544 --> 00:06:42.384
⟨un m'hot⟩ Poyln dos nakher tsugenumen.

00:06:42.384 --> 00:06:43.756
in SZCZECIN

00:06:44.556 --> 00:06:46.257
iz bin ikh gevezn

00:06:46.257 --> 00:06:47.300
a tog

00:06:47.644 --> 00:06:49.393
un ikh hob getrofn maynem

00:06:49.551 --> 00:06:52.802
a fraynt fun mayn shtot vos er hot dortn gevoynt

00:06:53.398 --> 00:06:56.733
hot er mir gezogt az mayn froy gefint zikh in Lodzh.

00:06:58.191 --> 00:07:03.855
bin ikh avekgeforn keyn Lodzh, un mayn froy hot gevoynt bay di shvester vos hot ibergelebt in katset.

00:07:04.536 --> 00:07:06.015
hot zi gevoynt in Lodzh.

00:07:09.379 --> 00:07:10.655
vos vayter?

00:07:11.050 --> 00:07:16.545
nu, un, un nakher, un a tsveyte shvester vos hot oykhet ibergelebt in katset

00:07:17.428 --> 00:07:18.851
iz, hot gevoynt

00:07:18.851 --> 00:07:20.142
in

00:07:20.142 --> 00:07:21.438
in GDANSK.

00:07:22.845 --> 00:07:28.005
zenen mir ahingeforn dortn tsu UNK dortn. der man iz gevezn in militer, nokh

00:07:28.005 --> 00:07:30.475
militerish ongetun in poylishn militer

00:07:30.475 --> 00:07:34.216
UNK ayngegebn dortn tsu farnemen a voynung

00:07:34.216 --> 00:07:37.301
fun a, fun a gevezenem daytshishn ofitsir.

00:07:37.543 --> 00:07:39.309
s'iz geven finef ROOMS.

00:07:40.075 --> 00:07:44.220
un v- di shtot hot geheysn lebn DANZIG WRZESZCZ

00:07:44.428 --> 00:07:47.375
un dortn zenen mir geven a gevise tsayt

00:07:47.466 --> 00:07:50.329
in, bay di, mayn froy's shvester

00:07:50.757 --> 00:07:52.928
un nakher zenen

00:07:53.068 --> 00:07:55.559
g- m'hot gezen az s'iz nishto in Poyln

00:07:56.190 --> 00:08:02.191
keyn oys⟨UNK⟩. me ken nisht. m'hot gemeynt az s'vet zikh in Poyln shafn a y- ken men shafn a yidishe yishev

00:08:02.265 --> 00:08:05.215
az di m- yidn vos zenen tsurikgekumen fun katset

00:08:05.215 --> 00:08:08.735
oder z- fun Rusland UNK kenen krik oyfboyen a yidish lebn

00:08:08.735 --> 00:08:12.117
ober di polyakn hobn nisht gelozt. s'iz shoyn geven a POLICY

00:08:12.117 --> 00:08:15.787
m'hot gemakht pogro- geharget in yede shtot, vu m'hot gekhapt a yid

00:08:15.787 --> 00:08:20.023
iz gevezn a, ⟨er⟩ hot geheysn A.K., ARMIA KRAJOWA

00:08:20.023 --> 00:08:21.649
un m'hot geharget yidn.

00:08:21.925 --> 00:08:23.859
nokhn Keltser pogrom

00:08:24.169 --> 00:08:28.753
iz a delegatsye fun yidn avekgeganen tsum kardinal WYSZYNSKI.

00:08:28.911 --> 00:08:32.586
m'hot gebetn az me zol oyfrufn di CHURCHES

00:08:32.586 --> 00:08:34.997
az me zol opshteln hargenen di yidn

00:08:35.273 --> 00:08:36.518
hot er geentfert

00:08:36.518 --> 00:08:39.817
NAJLEPIEJ BY BYLA UNK ZYDZI UNK POLSKI

00:08:39.817 --> 00:08:43.636
dos beste volt geven az yidn zoln aroysforn fun Poyln.

00:08:44.470 --> 00:08:47.850
der g- poli- POLICY iz gevezn fun di polyakn

00:08:47.850 --> 00:08:50.160
az yidn zoln zikh nisht bazetsn

00:08:50.190 --> 00:08:54.296
nokh di milkhome hot zikh geshafn a ⟨yishev⟩ in Pariz, in Frankraykh

00:08:54.296 --> 00:08:56.473
in BUENOS AIRES in Argentine

00:08:56.473 --> 00:08:59.282
un, un in Poyln hobn di Polyakn nisht gevolt

00:08:59.282 --> 00:09:01.726
az s'zol zikh tsurik shafn a yidishe

00:09:01.817 --> 00:09:08.004
yishev, a yidishe, az yidn zoln zikh bazetsn, hot men geharget yidn az yidn zoln antloyfn, un yidn zenen antlofn

00:09:09.647 --> 00:09:11.075
bin ikh oykhet

00:09:11.132 --> 00:09:13.320
bin ikh antlofn fun Poyln

00:09:13.782 --> 00:09:16.006
bin aribergeganen di

00:09:16.006 --> 00:09:17.690
s'ershte keyn Estraykh

00:09:18.388 --> 00:09:19.631
ven iz dos geven?

00:09:19.536 --> 00:09:21.842
nayntsn z- zeks un fertsik.

00:09:22.168 --> 00:09:25.790
ober ir zent nisht, ir hot nisht e- d- dergraykht biz tsu Gritse?

00:09:25.543 --> 00:09:27.733
ikh bin UNK yo. ikh hob in

00:09:27.733 --> 00:09:29.421
kumendik tsu forn

00:09:29.421 --> 00:09:31.741
bin ikh aropgeforn keyn Gritse

00:09:31.741 --> 00:09:33.907
zen efsher geblibn ver lebn.

00:09:34.369 --> 00:09:38.835
iz keyn yidn shoyn nisht geven. s'iz geven a etlekhene yidn vos zenen gekumen

00:09:39.263 --> 00:09:40.961
nokh di, fun di katset

00:09:41.355 --> 00:09:47.761
iz, iz dort gevezn a yid vos er hot geheysn Yankl VAYSMAN, a Gerer khosid gevezn

00:09:47.903 --> 00:09:49.697
a raykher yid geven

00:09:49.697 --> 00:09:50.833
gehat a gesheft

00:09:51.227 --> 00:09:53.527
iz ven ikh gey adurkh dos gevelb

00:09:53.527 --> 00:09:55.837
s'iz geven oyf di Amshinover gas

00:09:55.837 --> 00:09:58.007
gib ikh a kuk, shteyt dortn

00:09:58.007 --> 00:09:59.987
a polyak vos er, a shuster

00:09:59.987 --> 00:10:01.886
vos er hot zikh bay mir geneyt

00:10:02.483 --> 00:10:05.211
un er iz geven a groyser antisemit

00:10:05.571 --> 00:10:07.221
iz er hot mikh derzen

00:10:07.221 --> 00:10:09.081
un er hot keyn foter nisht gegat

00:10:09.081 --> 00:10:14.961
un er UNK a muter vos di muter hot mikh gekent fun a kindvayz oyf az er hot gekoyft bay undz in di BAKERY

00:10:15.105 --> 00:10:19.149
hot mikh derzen, hot ⟨im⟩ derfreyt. m'hot mikh arayngerufn

00:10:19.172 --> 00:10:21.582
un ⟨s'zenen nokh dem⟩ arayngerufn andere

00:10:21.582 --> 00:10:24.422
polyakn shusters vos zey hobn zikh bay mir gearbet

00:10:24.623 --> 00:10:29.274
un m'hot gemakht a, a sude. m'hot oyfgeshtelt bronfn mit esn

00:10:29.449 --> 00:10:33.257
un zi fregt mikh, di froy, zi hot geheysn ROZANSKI

00:10:33.516 --> 00:10:36.733
"ME, MENDELEK, GDZIE BEDZIESZ SPAL?"

00:10:36.823 --> 00:10:39.112
vu vestu shlofn?

00:10:39.135 --> 00:10:45.198
zog ikh "UNK, ikh veys nokh nisht, bin yetst gekumen, kh'veys nokh nisht," zogt zi ⟨vos⟩ "du kenst shlofn bay mir.

00:10:45.198 --> 00:10:48.888
nor ikh hob moyre, zey veln kumen bay di nakht, zey veln dikh derhargenen." zog ikh

00:10:48.888 --> 00:10:51.348
nokh di milkhome, zog ikh "far vos vet men mikh derhargenen?"

00:10:51.348 --> 00:10:53.608
zogt zi "du veyst dokh, yetst harget men yidn."

00:10:54.812 --> 00:10:56.611
bin ikh geven dortn

00:10:56.635 --> 00:10:59.481
t- tsvey tog. s'iz geven, gevoynt eyn yid

00:10:59.959 --> 00:11:01.708
oyf a boydem shtibl

00:11:02.322 --> 00:11:06.383
bin ikh dort geshlofn, tsi- yederer vos iz geblibn lebn

00:11:06.490 --> 00:11:09.285
iz aropgekumen in shtot, er ⟨hot gegebn⟩ a kuk

00:11:09.325 --> 00:11:12.103
tsi s'iz ver do, tsi s'iz ver lebn geblibn.

00:11:12.126 --> 00:11:14.533
iz er geven dortn bay di froy

00:11:14.809 --> 00:11:16.068
in dem shtub.

00:11:16.227 --> 00:11:17.506
un

00:11:17.506 --> 00:11:21.766
un m'hot moyre gegat. s'iz eyn mol geven an onfal oyf di shtot

00:11:21.766 --> 00:11:23.556
fun di A.K.

00:11:23.556 --> 00:11:26.186
az me zol undz nisht dortn umbrengen. s'iz

00:11:26.186 --> 00:11:30.031
m'hot iz, yidn geshosn dortn in, in di Gritse z-

00:11:30.031 --> 00:11:31.762
a yunger man, er hot gehandlt

00:11:32.055 --> 00:11:34.862
hot, mit hoyzn farkoyft. er iz ganen oyf a mark

00:11:34.862 --> 00:11:39.137
iz tsugekumen bay tog eyner an antisemit, hot men arayngeshosn a koyl in kop arayn

00:11:39.750 --> 00:11:44.317
un ikh hob dortn gehat mayns a, a feter's a hoyz

00:11:44.661 --> 00:11:47.085
hob ikh prubirt dos efsher farkoyfn.

00:11:47.158 --> 00:11:51.404
bin arayngan tsu dem goy, zogt er "du for avek, anisht vestu avekforn on a kop."

00:11:52.103 --> 00:11:53.565
bin ikh avekgeforn.

00:11:53.841 --> 00:11:56.433
bin shoyn mer nisht ge- bin avekgeforn.

00:11:56.760 --> 00:12:00.180
un nakher ⟨ikh⟩ bin avek fun Poyln, avek keyn Estraykh

00:12:00.180 --> 00:12:02.420
un fun Estraykh bin avek keyn Daytshland.

00:12:02.413 --> 00:12:03.672
vu in Daytshland?

00:12:03.392 --> 00:12:05.647
in Daytshland bin ikh geven in WETZLAR.

00:12:06.109 --> 00:12:09.495
WETZLAR dos iz a, nisht vayt fun FRANKFURT.

00:12:10.412 --> 00:12:14.473
iz dortn iz geven a lager, s'iz gevezn bay dray toyznt yidn

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:22.404
vos, vos zenen gekumen fun farshidene, fun di lagern, farshidene ⟨gegnt⟩ antlofn fun Poyln.

00:12:22.478 --> 00:12:27.517
s'iz geven yidn fun Tshekhn, yidn fun Ungarn, yidn fun, fun gants EUROPE.

00:12:28.249 --> 00:12:29.959
un dortn in lager

00:12:29.959 --> 00:12:31.652
bin ikh gevezn

00:12:32.552 --> 00:12:34.554
bizn akht un fertsikstn yor.

00:12:34.442 --> 00:12:38.908
ven zayt ir gevoyr gevo- geven vos iz gevorn mit ayer froy?

00:12:39.403 --> 00:12:44.657
mit mayn froy zog ikh hob ikh zikh getrofn in di, in Lodzh, vi ikh hob gezogt, ven ikh bin ave-

00:12:44.657 --> 00:12:48.864
gekumen tsu forn keyn Lodzh, iz d- mayn froy geven bay di shvester. zi iz oykh

00:12:47.858 --> 00:12:49.522
ah, OKAY, OH YEAH, OKAY.

00:12:49.528 --> 00:12:50.192
tsu

00:12:49.528 --> 00:12:52.812
az ir zent fun dortn z- geblibn tsuzamen?

00:12:50.192 --> 00:12:54.821
d- d- mir hobn in Poyln in, in DA in, in WRZESZCZ hobn mir khasene gegat

00:12:55.401 --> 00:12:56.593
in WRZESZCZ?

00:12:55.620 --> 00:12:58.854
bay di, bay di shvester, bay di yingere shvester vos zi UNK

00:12:57.915 --> 00:12:59.647
ven hot ir khasene gehat?

00:12:59.518 --> 00:13:01.132
in zeks un fertsikstn.

00:13:00.193 --> 00:13:04.054
in zeks, un ir zayt tsuzamen geforn keyn ah, keyn ah

00:13:02.758 --> 00:13:04.152
keyn Daytshland.

00:13:04.054 --> 00:13:04.979
WETZLAR.

00:13:04.800 --> 00:13:05.587
yo.

00:13:05.307 --> 00:13:08.456
un vi lang zent ir z- geven dortn in WETZLAR?

00:13:07.618 --> 00:13:11.223
bay tsvey yor. fun zeks un fertsik bizn akht un fertsik. mir

00:13:10.082 --> 00:13:12.539
un vos hot ir geton durkh di tsvey yorn?

00:13:12.006 --> 00:13:16.387
ikh hob gearbet dortn in, m'hot dortn in, in lager geven yidn

00:13:16.697 --> 00:13:18.108
vos

00:13:18.705 --> 00:13:22.175
m'hot gevo- s'iz geven a militerishe lager v- frier

00:13:22.468 --> 00:13:27.457
iz hot men gevoynt dortn in di, in di l- shtubn ⟨vu dos⟩ militer hot a mol gevoynt.

00:13:27.852 --> 00:13:32.014
iz hot men geheytst mit eyvelekh, hot men gedorfn hobn holts.

00:13:32.374 --> 00:13:35.152
UNK gekumen daytshn mit TRUCKS

00:13:35.158 --> 00:13:38.155
un a, yidn vos hobn gevolt krign a bisl

00:13:38.314 --> 00:13:42.352
der a- di UNRRA hot gegebn a kleynem payok, kleyn, vintsik esn

00:13:42.352 --> 00:13:43.989
UNK gevolt tsufardinen

00:13:43.989 --> 00:13:47.083
bin ikh geganen. ikh hob geshnitn holts in vald

00:13:47.848 --> 00:13:50.187
hob ikh gekrign fun JOINT oykhet

00:13:50.582 --> 00:13:52.989
a pekl dortn, gekrign CIGARETTES

00:13:52.995 --> 00:13:55.739
gekrign kave un andere zakhn.

00:13:57.214 --> 00:13:59.013
un nakher zent ir avek?

00:13:58.513 --> 00:14:00.366
nakher biz

00:14:00.366 --> 00:14:01.545
der

00:14:01.990 --> 00:14:04.889
d- yidn hot men nisht arayngelozt nokh di milkhome.

00:14:04.889 --> 00:14:06.978
m'hot arayngelozt NAZIS

00:14:07.103 --> 00:14:08.784
keyn Amerike, keyn

00:14:08.858 --> 00:14:11.299
keyn Frankraykh, umetum, nor yidn

00:14:11.355 --> 00:14:13.495
keyn CANADA oykh nisht

00:14:13.495 --> 00:14:16.515
iz di profesyonele fareynen, di UNIONS do

00:14:16.587 --> 00:14:19.753
hobn zikh gestaret az zey darfn hobn shnayders

00:14:20.097 --> 00:14:26.098
iz gekumen az m- in lager az me zol, az CANADA vil araynlozn a por hundert shnayders.

00:14:26.121 --> 00:14:28.039
ikh bin nisht geven keyn shnayder

00:14:28.635 --> 00:14:34.260
nor ikh bin gevezn, m'hot gevust fun mir der yidisher arbeter komitet in Amerike.

00:14:34.260 --> 00:14:35.869
ikh hob gehat dort fraynt

00:14:36.212 --> 00:14:39.783
veys nisht tsi ir hot gehert s'iz do in Amerike yidisher arbeter komitet

00:14:40.583 --> 00:14:46.415
iz, iz gekumen tsu forn eyner fun d- MONTREAL. zayn nomen iz geven SHEYN.

00:14:46.523 --> 00:14:50.347
er iz geven a firer fun di UNIONS, fun di shnayder UNIONS

00:14:50.522 --> 00:14:55.387
iz er gekumen mit a liste vos der yidisher arbeter komitet hot im gegebn

00:14:55.387 --> 00:14:59.814
az UNK oyb s'vet zayn azelekhe vos ⟨er iz⟩ nisht keyn shnayder, nor me darf im aroysnemen

00:14:59.955 --> 00:15:03.476
UNK a bisl protektsye, un ikh bin geven oyf di liste

00:15:03.972 --> 00:15:07.509
azoy az ikh bin gekumen als a shnayder do aher.

00:15:08.967 --> 00:15:11.745
zenen mir aroysgeforn, shnayders fun

00:15:12.122 --> 00:15:15.103
keyn CANADA. azoy hot men nisht gevolt araynlozn keyn yidn.

00:15:16.611 --> 00:15:19.912
un ir hot in, in dem gearbet durkh di ale yorn?

00:15:20.104 --> 00:15:21.245
vu, do?

00:15:20.121 --> 00:15:22.106
in, in, in shusteray?

00:15:22.112 --> 00:15:25.920
ikh hob gearbet do in a FACTORY fir un draysik yor.

00:15:26.652 --> 00:15:28.165
vifl kinder hot ir?

00:15:28.069 --> 00:15:29.092
tsvey.

00:15:29.723 --> 00:15:30.982
vi heysn zey?

00:15:30.887 --> 00:15:32.450
a zun MICHAEL

00:15:32.980 --> 00:15:34.408
ven iz er geboyrn?

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:34.003
un a

00:15:34.465 --> 00:15:37.783
in d- in dray un fuftsikstn yor.

00:15:38.582 --> 00:15:39.436
un

00:15:39.325 --> 00:15:40.652
un a tokhter

00:15:40.860 --> 00:15:41.866
ZINA

00:15:42.801 --> 00:15:47.385
zi iz, zi iz farheyrat. zi iz geboyrn in zibn un fuftsikstn yor.

00:15:49.078 --> 00:15:51.772
ah, hot ir gezogt, vi heyst ayer froy?

00:15:52.048 --> 00:15:53.409
m- Manye.

00:15:53.365 --> 00:15:56.447
Ma- Manye. vos iz geven a- ir ah

00:15:56.520 --> 00:15:57.796
meydlsh nomen?

00:15:58.157 --> 00:15:59.129
Manye.

00:15:58.900 --> 00:16:00.345
NO, ir meydlsh

00:15:59.203 --> 00:16:00.884
, oh, RAYTER.

00:16:00.655 --> 00:16:01.611
RAYTER.

00:16:02.106 --> 00:16:06.302
un zi shtam- ir hot ir gekent in, in Gritse, fun kindvayz on.

00:16:04.198 --> 00:16:05.879
fun Gritse, yo.

00:16:05.886 --> 00:16:06.723
yo.

00:16:08.417 --> 00:16:09.913
un ir hot eyniklekh?

00:16:10.122 --> 00:16:12.529
yo. ikh hob fir eyniklekh.

00:16:13.362 --> 00:16:16.208
tsvey fun mayn zun, tsvey fun mayn tokhter.

00:16:15.117 --> 00:16:17.591
un vi heysn zey? vifl alt zaynen zey?

00:16:17.310 --> 00:16:21.556
mayn zun's tokhter iz shoyn eyn un tsvontsik. zi heyst CATHY

00:16:21.850 --> 00:16:24.257
un a BOY, heyst er JAMIE.

00:16:24.398 --> 00:16:25.449
er iz

00:16:25.449 --> 00:16:27.784
shoyn drayts- UNK draytsn yor.

00:16:27.975 --> 00:16:34.044
mayn tokhter hot a, a z- a yingele fun elef yor un a meydele fun zeks yor.

00:16:35.518 --> 00:16:36.642
zent i-

00:16:35.586 --> 00:16:37.301
mayn tokhter vet do zayn.

00:16:37.054 --> 00:16:41.655
zent ir do a mitglid in a, in a shul oder in an organizatsye?

00:16:40.918 --> 00:16:42.797
NO. ikh bin a

00:16:42.797 --> 00:16:44.692
ikh bin a mitglid in arbeter ring.

00:16:44.597 --> 00:16:45.755
in arbeter ring.

00:16:47.162 --> 00:16:48.506
MISTER BAKER

00:16:49.356 --> 00:16:53.906
vos darfn mir lernen fun di ale zakhn? vos kenen mir aroysnemen?

00:16:52.258 --> 00:16:54.159
yo, s'iz zeyer vikhtik.

00:16:54.638 --> 00:16:56.066
ikh hob gedenkt

00:16:56.106 --> 00:16:57.652
az nokh dem

00:16:58.367 --> 00:16:59.284
vi

00:16:59.284 --> 00:17:04.622
di tsvey, di, vos di velt hot praktitsirt in di tsveyte velt milkhome

00:17:04.694 --> 00:17:08.430
az azolkhe tsvey merder vi Hitler un Stalin k-

00:17:08.430 --> 00:17:09.720
kumen tsu makht

00:17:09.720 --> 00:17:11.439
kenen zey umbrengen a velt.

00:17:11.984 --> 00:17:14.307
un nokh a zakh vos ikh hob gelernt

00:17:14.601 --> 00:17:18.476
az di velt darf zayn zeyer forzikhtik. me zet yetst

00:17:18.667 --> 00:17:21.023
az der fanatisher

00:17:21.317 --> 00:17:24.028
fan- religyeze fanatikers

00:17:24.185 --> 00:17:25.647
un shovenizm

00:17:26.160 --> 00:17:29.225
iz a shreklekhe sakone far di mentshheyt.

00:17:29.670 --> 00:17:32.465
mir zeen yetst vos kumt for in Yugoslavye

00:17:32.607 --> 00:17:35.672
vi mentshn hargenen zikh oys eyns ⟨dos⟩ andere.

00:17:35.863 --> 00:17:38.658
ikh, mir hobn gehoft nokh di milkhome

00:17:39.070 --> 00:17:44.323
az azolkhe tsvey merder vi Hitler un Stalin vos zey hobn umgebrengt fuftsik milyon

00:17:44.323 --> 00:17:46.236
umshuldike mentshn

00:17:46.444 --> 00:17:48.609
az di velt vet hobn a LESSON

00:17:48.609 --> 00:17:49.796
az nor

00:17:49.954 --> 00:17:52.462
durkh demokratishe

00:17:52.603 --> 00:17:53.536
vegn

00:17:53.536 --> 00:17:55.466
az di, durkh lib

00:17:55.472 --> 00:17:57.845
di frayheyt fun mentsh

00:17:58.138 --> 00:17:59.161
un

00:17:59.640 --> 00:18:01.695
di, durkh di f-

00:18:01.695 --> 00:18:03.650
frayndshaft fun felker

00:18:03.943 --> 00:18:06.311
ken farzikhern di ekzistents

00:18:06.311 --> 00:18:09.489
fun di velt. oyb mir veln kholile

00:18:09.816 --> 00:18:14.377
geyn ⟨oyf⟩ hobn nokh a mol a, a Hitler oder a Stalin

00:18:14.377 --> 00:18:16.610
in di tsayt ven s'iz do atom

00:18:16.785 --> 00:18:17.676
un ikh

00:18:17.676 --> 00:18:22.587
bin zikher az in tsvontsik yor arum vet yedes land shoyn kenen makhn an atom bombe

00:18:22.587 --> 00:18:24.342
volt di velt nisht hobn keyn kiem.

00:18:24.342 --> 00:18:25.976
nor in di vegn

00:18:25.982 --> 00:18:27.883
dos darf zayn a lektsye

00:18:27.889 --> 00:18:28.578
az

00:18:28.578 --> 00:18:30.617
der mentsh darf zayn fray

00:18:30.623 --> 00:18:34.585
az n- gegn ratsi- tor nisht ekzistirn keyn ratsizm.

00:18:34.585 --> 00:18:37.502
mentshn darfn lebn in frayndshaft

00:18:37.626 --> 00:18:41.062
un, un eyn mentsh darf nisht oysnitsn dem andern

00:18:41.203 --> 00:18:44.673
vayl ale mentshn zenen geboyrn gevorn glaykh

00:18:44.916 --> 00:18:46.819
un m- eyn mentsh darf

00:18:46.819 --> 00:18:51.232
respektirn dem andern, un eyn folk darf respektirn dem andern.

00:18:51.025 --> 00:18:52.369
tsi iz Yisroel

00:18:51.232 --> 00:18:53.030
dos darf zayn di lektsye

00:18:53.030 --> 00:18:56.301
vos hot undz gegebn di v- tsveyte velt milkhome.

00:18:55.918 --> 00:18:57.616
tsi iz Yisroel vikhtik?

00:18:57.842 --> 00:18:58.730
bite?

00:18:58.180 --> 00:19:00.773
Yisroel. tsi iz Yisroel vikhtik?

00:19:00.458 --> 00:19:03.641
Yisroel iz zeyer a v- zeyer vikhtik

00:19:03.681 --> 00:19:04.603
vayl

00:19:04.626 --> 00:19:08.315
Yis- Yi- oyb s'iz gevezn a tsayt

00:19:08.558 --> 00:19:11.100
ven s'hot kholile gedrot

00:19:11.190 --> 00:19:13.766
yidn in di goles lender

00:19:13.806 --> 00:19:18.334
umtsukumen. mir, vi a, ikh bin geven a, a sotsyal demokrat

00:19:18.334 --> 00:19:19.473
hob ikh gehoft

00:19:19.473 --> 00:19:22.322
az ge- nisht bloyz gehoft, gekemft

00:19:22.648 --> 00:19:24.366
az yidn veln t- f-

00:19:24.366 --> 00:19:26.675
d- hobn, zoln hobn di zelbe rekht

00:19:27.238 --> 00:19:32.188
vos di l- di lender vos zey voynen, zoln zey hobn di zelbe flikht un di zelbe rekht

00:19:32.188 --> 00:19:34.068
zoln nisht vern diskriminirt

00:19:34.068 --> 00:19:37.818
ober aroysgevizn zikh az dos hot zikh nisht ayngegebn.

00:19:37.818 --> 00:19:44.118
az di, d- afilek di komunistn, m'hot gehaltn dortn in di ratn farband az zey zenen UNK zayn di bafrayer

00:19:44.118 --> 00:19:47.701
zenen zey geven di greste antisemitn un di greste unterdruker

00:19:47.701 --> 00:19:49.274
azoy az Yisroel

00:19:49.274 --> 00:19:51.245
az UNK az Yisroel

00:19:51.319 --> 00:19:54.049
az ⟨ven⟩ yidn veln hobn a yidishe melukhe

00:19:54.049 --> 00:19:56.439
veln oykh di yidn vos veln lebn

00:19:56.439 --> 00:19:59.629
in di azoy gerufene tseshpreytkeyt in di velt

00:19:59.629 --> 00:20:00.437
hobn

00:20:00.437 --> 00:20:02.046
mer respekt

00:20:02.338 --> 00:20:05.167
vi, az Yisroel vet ekzistirn.

00:20:04.971 --> 00:20:08.120
tsi s'iz vikhtik az me zol blaybn yidn?

00:20:08.447 --> 00:20:11.208
umbadingt. mir hobn ale mol gekemft

00:20:11.485 --> 00:20:13.352
gegn asimilatsye.

00:20:13.476 --> 00:20:17.497
mir hobn gekemft far natsyonale kulturele oytonomye

00:20:17.497 --> 00:20:19.632
az yidn do vu zey lebn

00:20:19.632 --> 00:20:23.122
zoln zikh kenen oyslebn vi veltlekhe yidn

00:20:23.145 --> 00:20:25.125
kenen hobn zeyer shprakh

00:20:25.125 --> 00:20:26.495
zeyer kultur

00:20:26.495 --> 00:20:28.405
un zey kenen lebn vi yidn.

00:20:28.039 --> 00:20:30.699
vos mit religye? iz es vikhtik?

00:20:30.199 --> 00:20:31.359
religye

00:20:31.359 --> 00:20:35.139
di religye hot undz gegebn ts- yeder eyner mentsh hot a rekht ts-

00:20:35.139 --> 00:20:37.859
tsu zayn vos er vil. er ken zayn religyez

00:20:37.859 --> 00:20:41.267
ober religye darf men nisht opvarfn oyf andere.

00:20:41.267 --> 00:20:44.587
⟨yetst vilt ir⟩ zayn religyez, bite zeyer, darf men nisht shtern

00:20:44.587 --> 00:20:47.183
ober er darf nisht aroyftsvingen religye oyf

00:20:47.183 --> 00:20:49.713
eyner vos er vil nisht zayn religyez.

00:20:49.713 --> 00:20:52.114
un nokh a zakh, ⟨vos⟩ religye ⟨hot⟩ bavizn

00:20:52.204 --> 00:20:53.801
der poylisher folk

00:20:54.111 --> 00:20:56.495
iz nayntsik protsent katolikn

00:20:56.495 --> 00:20:58.714
un zenen geganen in di CHURCHES

00:20:58.714 --> 00:21:01.043
nor ven m'hot gedorfn hargenen yidn

00:21:01.043 --> 00:21:03.102
iz gornisht geshat zey dertsu.

00:21:03.102 --> 00:21:04.528
iz nokh yetst

00:21:04.528 --> 00:21:09.123
oyb s'iz nokh do aza religyezer fanatizm vi s'iz a KHOMEINI

00:21:09.197 --> 00:21:12.940
oder azelkhe fanatiker fun di yidn, vi UNK hot geharget

00:21:12.940 --> 00:21:15.165
dem yisroeldikn PRIME MINISTER

00:21:15.205 --> 00:21:18.810
azolkhe fanatiker, dos iz g- shedlekh far a folk.

00:21:21.111 --> 00:21:26.066
vilt ir nokh epes tsugebn fun di ale yorn vos ir UNK epes fargesn

00:21:26.123 --> 00:21:27.146
tsu zogn

00:21:27.658 --> 00:21:28.710
biz aher

00:21:28.710 --> 00:21:30.319
oder nit gezogt?

00:21:29.953 --> 00:21:32.566
ikh, ikh volt gevolt zogn az

00:21:32.566 --> 00:21:35.232
mir lebn in a g- in a gut land

00:21:35.232 --> 00:21:36.275
CANADA

00:21:37.075 --> 00:21:43.070
un vos di, mit yidn lebn zikh oys hagam s'iz do do oykhet antisemitn

00:21:43.070 --> 00:21:45.674
ober me darf zogn gamze letoyve

00:21:45.900 --> 00:21:49.691
az dervayl lebn zikh oys vi azoy nisht shlekht

00:21:50.001 --> 00:21:53.471
un yidn lebn zikh do gants fray

00:21:53.578 --> 00:21:56.474
un, un nokh a zakh vos di

00:21:56.768 --> 00:21:58.739
in ale andere lender

00:21:58.739 --> 00:22:02.279
di natsyonale minderheytn zenen unterdrikt.

00:22:02.370 --> 00:22:03.683
me roydeft zey.

00:22:03.683 --> 00:22:07.157
do in land lebn azoy fil felker, un keyner

00:22:07.365 --> 00:22:11.277
un s'iz dokh do oykhet ratsistn, ober zey hobn nisht dem koyekh

00:22:11.277 --> 00:22:12.793
un ikh vil hofn

00:22:13.120 --> 00:22:14.514
az

00:22:14.672 --> 00:22:19.014
CANADA un Amerike un andere lender vu yidn lebn

00:22:19.014 --> 00:22:21.467
veln zey kenen zikh oyslebn vi

00:22:21.608 --> 00:22:23.880
far vos hot ir haynt gemakht dem intervyu?

00:22:24.375 --> 00:22:30.224
ikh hob gemakht dem intervyu, ikh hob aykh a mol gezogt az UNK hobn mir gehat a groysn historiker

00:22:30.619 --> 00:22:32.773
vos er hot geheysn DUBNOV

00:22:32.863 --> 00:22:36.053
er, leyder, m'hot im umgebrengt in Kovne

00:22:36.053 --> 00:22:41.993
hot er geshrign tsu yidn "yidn, farshraybt aldings, zol di velt visn vos geshet tsum yidishn folk."

00:22:42.145 --> 00:22:43.421
un ikh halt

00:22:43.427 --> 00:22:45.617
az s'iz zeyer vikhtik dos

00:22:45.617 --> 00:22:48.871
vos di SURVIVORS, di vos zenen geblibn nokh lebn

00:22:49.350 --> 00:22:50.981
zoln dertseyln

00:22:52.017 --> 00:22:54.559
dos zol blaybn ledor doyres

00:22:54.919 --> 00:22:56.246
vos Amolek

00:22:56.742 --> 00:22:57.979
der daytsh

00:22:57.979 --> 00:23:02.119
oder ale andere yidn faynt hobn getun tsu di yidishe folk.

00:23:02.361 --> 00:23:04.346
derfar darfn mir dos alts

00:23:04.470 --> 00:23:05.324
far-

00:23:05.449 --> 00:23:06.863
farshraybn

00:23:06.863 --> 00:23:08.669
far- me zol gedenken

00:23:08.669 --> 00:23:10.229
far dor doyres

00:23:10.229 --> 00:23:12.364
dos zol ongeyn az di kinder

00:23:12.364 --> 00:23:13.925
un kind's kinder

00:23:13.925 --> 00:23:15.315
zoln dos visn.

00:23:16.823 --> 00:23:18.203
ayere kind's

00:23:18.203 --> 00:23:21.710
kinder veln dos take zen, dos vos ir hot haynt geredt.

00:23:22.273 --> 00:23:24.177
vos vilt ir zogn tsu di

00:23:24.177 --> 00:23:27.296
kumendike doyres fun, fun ayer mishpokhe?

00:23:32.584 --> 00:23:35.025
az UNK ikh volt gezogt

00:23:35.689 --> 00:23:38.450
tsu mayne kinder un eyniklekh

00:23:38.676 --> 00:23:40.712
az vos zol nisht geshen

00:23:41.022 --> 00:23:45.268
yidn zenen a folk mit traditsye, dos eltste folk

00:23:45.730 --> 00:23:47.361
in di velt

00:23:47.670 --> 00:23:49.368
az, un yidn

00:23:49.476 --> 00:23:55.005
zenen a folk vos hobn keyn mol nisht gemakht keyn ⟨WAR⟩, keyn m- milkhomes. UNK hobn keynem

00:23:55.095 --> 00:23:56.661
mir hobn gelernt

00:23:56.661 --> 00:23:59.966
in undzere kinder tsu shaneven

00:24:00.090 --> 00:24:03.436
un tsu respektirn yed- andere mentshn

00:24:03.436 --> 00:24:04.820
az zoln blaybn

00:24:04.820 --> 00:24:06.193
zoln blaybn yidn.

00:24:07.819 --> 00:24:09.635
MISTER BAKER, a sheynem dank.

00:24:09.760 --> 00:24:11.225
a sheynem dank aykh

00:24:11.225 --> 00:24:12.473
un a sheynem dank

00:24:12.473 --> 00:24:13.247
dir.

00:24:13.270 --> 00:24:14.057
UNK

00:24:18.417 --> 00:24:20.605
dos iz mayn shvester Khane.

00:24:20.796 --> 00:24:23.625
zi iz alt gevezn far di milkhome

00:24:24.120 --> 00:24:25.869
dray un tsvontsik yor.

00:24:25.707 --> 00:24:27.338
ven iz dos genumen gevorn?

00:24:27.124 --> 00:24:30.276
dos iz genumen gevorn in, in nayntsn

00:24:30.276 --> 00:24:32.146
akht un draysik.

00:24:31.309 --> 00:24:32.383
vu?

00:24:32.592 --> 00:24:33.767
in Gritse.

00:24:36.810 --> 00:24:41.667
dos iz mayn bruder Moyshe, der yingster bruder. er iz alt gevezn

00:24:41.667 --> 00:24:43.065
akhtsn yor.

00:24:42.885 --> 00:24:45.123
velkhe iz er, oyf der rekhter?

00:24:44.185 --> 00:24:45.664
di rekhte zayt.

00:24:46.227 --> 00:24:47.655
un oyf der linker zayt?

00:24:47.425 --> 00:24:48.577
iz a khaver

00:24:48.577 --> 00:24:49.544
zayns.

00:24:49.905 --> 00:24:50.979
vi heyst er?

00:24:50.682 --> 00:24:51.958
veys ikh nisht.

00:24:52.268 --> 00:24:53.966
ven iz dos genumen gevorn?

00:24:53.702 --> 00:24:57.796
dos iz genumen gevorn oykhet azoy in akht un draysikstn yor.

00:25:00.402 --> 00:25:03.942
fun di linke zayt iz mayn shvester Sorl

00:25:03.942 --> 00:25:06.296
mit ir man, Shie Farber

00:25:06.296 --> 00:25:09.221
un mayn shvegerin Tsirl FREYDNBERG.

00:25:09.548 --> 00:25:11.229
ven iz dos genumen gevorn?

00:25:10.965 --> 00:25:12.089
in geto.

00:25:12.568 --> 00:25:13.743
in velkhn yor?

00:25:13.632 --> 00:25:19.569
dos bin ikh shoyn nisht geven. dos iz vayzt oys gevezn ven ikh bin avek, ober UNK demolts ven m'hot shoyn gemakht

00:25:19.569 --> 00:25:23.683
zenen geganen mit di orem bender mitn mogn Dovid

00:25:23.419 --> 00:25:26.079
dos iz in Gritse? in Varshe.

00:25:23.925 --> 00:25:25.927
in Varshe, Varshe.

00:25:29.967 --> 00:25:33.791
fun di rekhte zayt iz mayn shvoger, Shie Farber

00:25:34.101 --> 00:25:35.259
fun di lin-

00:25:34.168 --> 00:25:37.165
der rekhter zayt in hishte- hintershtn rey?

00:25:36.531 --> 00:25:41.756
in di heykh, in di heykh. in di heykh ⟨an⟩ di linke zayt Leybl VASERMAN

00:25:37.307 --> 00:25:38.685
in heykh, OKAY.

00:25:41.897 --> 00:25:43.944
un der tsveyter iz

00:25:43.944 --> 00:25:49.519
iz Shimen VASERMAN. ⟨in⟩ di mit iz Ya- a COUSIN Yankl Beker.

00:25:50.132 --> 00:25:55.728
un dos, di bild iz a, a bild fun yugnt, fun a yugnt trup in Gritse.

00:25:50.149 --> 00:25:51.206
un ver no-

00:25:55.752 --> 00:25:57.619
s'iz do nokh andere kroyvim?

00:25:57.507 --> 00:25:58.783
do nisht.

00:25:59.329 --> 00:26:03.153
oyf der ah rekhter zayt in, in, in hinersh- hintershtn rey?

00:26:02.687 --> 00:26:05.853
d- in di untershte i- NO, iz nisht keyn kroyvim.

00:26:09.302 --> 00:26:10.699
dos bin ikh

00:26:10.699 --> 00:26:17.109
nokh di milkhome mit mayn vayb. di PIC- dos bild iz genumen gevorn in zibn un fertsikstn yor

00:26:17.250 --> 00:26:21.631
un, fun di heym heyst mayn froy Manye RAYTER.

00:26:21.756 --> 00:26:23.488
vu iz dos genumen gevorn?

00:26:23.190 --> 00:26:26.272
in, dos bild iz genumen gevorn in Daytshland.

00:26:26.160 --> 00:26:29.023
un ir shteyt lebn a hoyz?

00:26:28.928 --> 00:26:32.196
dos iz, dos iz gemakht gevorn lebn a hoyz, yo.

00:26:31.881 --> 00:26:33.590
ir zent dortn geblibn?

00:26:33.585 --> 00:26:38.726
NO, NO, mir, dos, UNK gemakht dort, a khaver hot genumen dos, dos, di, dos bild.

00:26:33.590 --> 00:26:35.401
s'iz stam gemakht a s-

00:26:42.023 --> 00:26:45.544
dos bild iz mayn zun MICHAEL

00:26:45.955 --> 00:26:46.995
in

00:26:47.001 --> 00:26:50.466
di, tsu di BIRTHDAY fun finef yor. er vert finef yor alt.

00:26:50.466 --> 00:26:55.517
un derlebn im zitsn di, zayne fraynt Khaim FRIDER

00:26:55.540 --> 00:26:58.178
er lebt yetst. UNK voynt in TORONTO

00:26:58.178 --> 00:27:02.436
un Eydl REINHARTZ. zi iz a profesor

00:27:02.509 --> 00:27:04.038
in, fun

00:27:04.146 --> 00:27:05.726
fun universitet.

00:27:05.445 --> 00:27:06.772
vi heyst der zun?

00:27:06.930 --> 00:27:07.970
MICHAEL.

00:27:07.808 --> 00:27:09.405
in velkhn yor iz dos?

00:27:09.141 --> 00:27:16.790
dos iz in, finef yor alt. dos heyst er iz geboyrn dray un fuftsik, un dos bild iz genumen in akht un fuftsik in UNK a BIRTHDAY.

00:27:16.800 --> 00:27:17.800
in TORONTO?

00:27:17.410 --> 00:27:18.550
in TORONTO.

00:27:18.793 --> 00:27:19.765
ba-

00:27:21.628 --> 00:27:23.512
dos zenen mayne kinder

00:27:24.578 --> 00:27:25.582
ZINY

00:27:25.582 --> 00:27:30.670
un MICHAEL. zenen do do oyfn, dos iz, iz, denk ikh, iz in CENTRE ISLAND

00:27:30.670 --> 00:27:34.313
iz er leyent a, a b- a bukh, un zi zitst derlebn.

00:27:34.234 --> 00:27:35.460
in velkhn yor?

00:27:35.719 --> 00:27:37.716
denk az dos iz gevezn

00:27:37.716 --> 00:27:39.291
UNK

00:27:39.364 --> 00:27:41.332
in zekhtsikstn yor efsher

00:27:41.372 --> 00:27:43.931
gedenk nisht genoy. dos, me shraybt UNK

00:27:43.954 --> 00:27:44.842
oyf di

00:27:46.738 --> 00:27:50.962
dos iz mayn zun MICHAEL vos er iz alt gevorn draytsn yor

00:27:50.962 --> 00:27:52.486
far di bal mitsve

00:27:52.628 --> 00:27:54.461
hot men gemakht dos bild.

00:27:54.433 --> 00:27:55.962
in zeks un zekhtsik?

00:27:56.307 --> 00:27:57.819
in, in TORONTO?

00:27:57.437 --> 00:27:59.236
yo, in TORONTO.

00:28:01.690 --> 00:28:04.704
dos iz mayn tokhter ZINY mit ir man

00:28:04.980 --> 00:28:09.901
GARY KIRSHENBAUM mit zeyer k- yingele vos iz dos ershte kind

00:28:09.942 --> 00:28:11.657
JA- JESSE.

00:28:11.427 --> 00:28:12.585
in velkhn yor?

00:28:12.456 --> 00:28:15.032
dos iz genu- genumen gevorn

00:28:15.223 --> 00:28:19.689
bald a tsen yor tsurik. dos vet heysn zeks un akhtsikstn.

00:28:23.847 --> 00:28:29.108
do iz, mentshn zenen fun mayn shtot, Gritse, zenen geven vaser treger.

00:28:29.108 --> 00:28:31.530
zey hobn getrogn vaser tsu mentshn

00:28:31.530 --> 00:28:36.272
far finef groshn hobn zey getrogn tsvey vyadre- tsvey kibles mit vaser

00:28:36.272 --> 00:28:41.275
UNK der mitn yidishn hitl heyst Yoyel. er hot getrogn vaser tsu undz in di BAKERY.

00:28:41.275 --> 00:28:43.123
der tsveyter hot men gerufn

00:28:43.123 --> 00:28:46.160
Hershl Goyder, hot er gehat a bisl a goyder

00:28:46.160 --> 00:28:50.170
UNK gevezn a mentsh vos er hot nisht gegat keyn froy

00:28:50.170 --> 00:28:54.280
an oremer yid, hot getrogn vaser, un dos iz geven zayn lebn.

00:28:54.280 --> 00:28:59.852
un dos iz a yidl vos hot gevoynt in di zelbe gas. dos bild iz genumen gevorn far di milkhome

00:28:59.925 --> 00:29:02.315
durkh eyner vos er iz arumgeforn

00:29:02.338 --> 00:29:05.908
ikh gedenk nisht zayn nomen, vos er hot genumen azolkhe farshidene

00:29:05.908 --> 00:29:08.068
yidishe tipn er hot fotografirt.

00:29:07.755 --> 00:29:09.453
dos hayzkele iz vos?

00:29:09.628 --> 00:29:10.668
di hayzk-

00:29:10.894 --> 00:29:16.271
di hayzke iz geven dortn vu s'iz geven der kval fun vaser. fun dortn hot men getrogn dos vaser in shtot.

00:29:19.753 --> 00:29:20.855
dos iz a b-

00:29:20.855 --> 00:29:26.815
a matseyve UNK iz geven a levaye vos m'hot oysgegrobn tsvey hundert yidn in a masn keyver.

00:29:26.815 --> 00:29:29.485
m'hot zey ibergefirt oyfn yidishn besoylem

00:29:29.485 --> 00:29:31.160
un dortn koyver tsu zayn

00:29:31.160 --> 00:29:36.840
un dos iz di matseyve. dos andere iz di matseyve vos m'hot zey avekgeshtelt. di rekhte zayt iz di matseyve.

00:29:33.642 --> 00:29:35.205
oyf der rekhter zayt?

00:29:36.848 --> 00:29:40.138
un dos iz di meldung vegn di levaye. m'hot zey oysgekopet

00:29:40.138 --> 00:29:43.858
fun a masn keyver un ibergefirt oyfn yidishn besoylem.

00:29:42.619 --> 00:29:44.776
vu iz dos? in Gritse?

00:29:43.902 --> 00:29:45.111
in Gritse.

00:29:47.665 --> 00:29:52.181
dos iz mayn froy, Manye. mir zenen farheyrat fuftsik yor

00:29:52.491 --> 00:29:55.010
un ikh hof az mir veln nokh

00:29:55.010 --> 00:29:58.056
nokh a tsvontsik yor kenen le- lebn tsuzamen.
